From: Anland Hyprland Maintainers
Date: Fri, 8 Aug 2026 06:00:00 +0800
Subject: compat: include unistd for close

AnlandInput uses the POSIX close() function when releasing descriptors
received from the Android producer.  Declare it explicitly on Linux.

---
 src/backend/anland/AnlandInput.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/backend/anland/AnlandInput.cpp b/src/backend/anland/AnlandInput.cpp
--- a/src/backend/anland/AnlandInput.cpp
+++ b/src/backend/anland/AnlandInput.cpp
@@ -9,1 +9,2 @@
 #include <poll.h>
+#include <unistd.h>
